          ],
          "basis": "sourced",
          "review_state": "unreviewed"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "chp_bp",
          "text": "Put the cuff on the bare upper arm and follow the device instructions, arm supported and still. The level that needs action: to be set by clinical review. Never delay or stop rest or the spacewalk check for this.",
